# The non-snapshot premise: only keys untouched for the whole scan are promised; a write the
# scan races is not.
MODULE: StableKeysCountedUntrackedWrite
TARGET: StableKeysCounted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a write during the scan is not treated as concurrent with it
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
    /\ touched' = IF phase = "Idle" THEN touched ELSE touched \cup {k}
--- REPLACE
    /\ touched' = touched
--- END
